      <p class="eyebrow">Help Shape the Home Mix</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl text-forest-700 md:text-4xl">Instead of choosing from available units, tell us what would actually fit your life.</h2>
      <p class="prose-body mt-4">This is the part that matters most right now. Your answers guide which home types get designed further, and in what proportions. It takes about a minute, and it obligates you to nothing.</p>
      <form
        id="fit-form"
